&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注)１．主な相手先別の販売実績及び総販売実績に対する割合&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:15pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
